msgstr "NOTES DE RECHERCHES"

msgctxt "woh_small:585"
msgid "(...) The pillars are related to the cult of T(...), a fertility goddess. People here refuse to help us with the work and forbid us from researching the village's archives. (...)"
msgstr "(...) Les colonnes sont reliées au culte de T(...), déesse de la fertilité. Les gens d'ici refusent de nous aider et nous interdisent l'accès aux archives du village. (...)"

msgctxt "woh_small:586"
msgid "You nearly trip over a brick laying on the floor."
msgstr "Vous manquez de trébucher sur une brique qui traînait au sol."

msgctxt "woh_small:587"
msgid "You decide to pick it up."
msgstr "Vous décidez de la ramasser."

msgctxt "woh_small:588"
msgid "You throw the pack of cigarettes away."
msgstr "Vous jetez le paquet de cigarettes."

msgctxt "woh_small:589"
msgid ""
"-AURA OF AZAL-HOTH-\n"
"\n"
"<<the cult can't be allowed to have this cursed book!>>\n"
"\n"
"completing a mystery lowers DOOM by 10%\n"
"[PASSIVE]"
msgstr ""
"-AURA D'AZAL-HOTH-\n"
"\n"
"<<ce livre ne doit pas tomber entre les mains du culte !>>\n"
"\n"
"terminer un mystère réduit la CALAMITÉ de 10%\n"
"[PASSIF]"

msgctxt "woh_small:590"
msgid ""
"The NECRONOMICON you've stolen contains powerful spells and horrible secrets.\n"
"To activate its power, retrieve more pages when you level up."
msgstr ""
"Le NÉCRONOMICON que vous avez volé contient de puissants sorts et d'horribles secrets.\n"
"Pour activer sa puissance, retrouvez plus de pages en montant de niveau."

msgctxt "woh_small:591"
msgid "The power of RAGH-ZHULL fills you! (+1 DAMAGE)"
msgstr "Le pouvoir de RAGH-ZHULL vous renforce ! (+1 DGT)"

msgctxt "woh_small:592"
msgid "F'THOTH cleanses your surroundings! (-3% DOOM)"
msgstr "F'THOTH nettoie les environs ! (-3% CALAMITÉ)"

msgctxt "woh_small:593"
msgid "You don't have enough experience!"
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas assez de points d'expérience !"

msgctxt "woh_small:594"
msgid "SHEBBE cares deeply for her followers!"
msgstr "SHEBBE prend soin de ses fidèles !"

msgctxt "woh_small:595"
msgid "So it shall be done. (+15% DOOM)"
msgstr "Ainsi soit-il. (+15% CALAMITÉ)"

msgctxt "woh_small:596"
msgid "CTHUR-IZTO mends your flesh! (+3 STAMINA / +3 REASON)"
msgstr "CTHUR-IZTO panse vos plaies ! (+3 ENDURANCE / +3 LUCIDITÉ)"

msgctxt "woh_small:597"
msgid ""
"is trembling with fear.\n"
"<<P-please, don't make me attack t-them.>>"
msgstr ""
"tremble de peur.\n"
"<<N-Non... ne me forcez p-pas à les attaquer.>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:598"
msgid ""
"gulps and clenches their fists.\n"
" <<w-we'll make it out of this alive, for sure!>>"
msgstr ""
"déglutit et serre les poings.\n"
"<<O-On va s'en sortir... p-promis !>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:599"
msgid "barks knowingly."
msgstr "aboie avec complicité."

msgctxt "woh_small:600"
msgid "is wagging its tail."
msgstr "remue la queue."

msgctxt "woh_small:601"
msgid "looks at you as you pat its head."
msgstr "vous regarde lui caresser la tête."

msgctxt "woh_small:602"
msgid ""
"looks around, uncertain.\n"
"\n"
"<<Let's get out of this forest, okay?>>"
msgstr ""
"regarde de tous les côtés, l'air hésitant.\n"
"\n"
"<<Sortons de cette forêt, d'accord ?>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:603"
msgid ""
"suddenly stops.\n"
"\n"
"<<W-what was that noise?...>>"
msgstr ""
"s'arrête abruptement.\n"
"\n"
"<<C-C'était quoi ce bruit... ?!>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:604"
msgid ""
"smiles a bit.\n"
"\n"
"<<At least the weather is nice.>>"
msgstr ""
"sourit légèrement.\n"
"\n"
"<<Au moins, la météo est au rendez-vous.>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:605"
msgid ""
"shivers.\n"
"\n"
"<<I don't like the way the villagers look at us...>>"
msgstr ""
"frissonne.\n"
"\n"
"<<Je n'aime pas la façon dont les villageois nous regardent...>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:606"
msgid ""
"gets closer.\n"
"\n"
"<<Should we be wearing masks? It looks like everyone else is...>>"
msgstr ""
"s'approche.\n"
"\n"
"<<Devrions-nous nous aussi porter des masques ? Tous les autres en portent un...>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:607"
msgid ""
"looks around.\n"
"\n"
"<<We spent one summer vacation in this village a few years ago.>>"
msgstr ""
"regarde de tous les côtés.\n"
"\n"
"<<C'est dans ce village qu'on a passé nos vacances, l'an dernier.>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:608"
msgid ""
"sniffs.\n"
"\n"
"<<What's that smell?>>"
msgstr ""
"renifle\n"
"\n"
"<<C'est quoi cette odeur... ?>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:609"
msgid ""
"grabs your arm.\n"
"\n"
"<<You know, they say this hospital is haunted... but that's just an urban legend, right?>>"
msgstr ""
"vous attrape le bras.\n"
"\n"
"<<Attends... on raconte que cet hôpital est hanté... mais c'est juste une légende urbaine, hein ?>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:610"
msgid ": <<Can I just stay in the waiting room and read a magazine?>>"
msgstr " : <<Est-ce que je peux rester dans la salle d'attente à lire des magazines ?>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:611"
msgid ""
"touches your arm.\n"
"\n"
"<<There's a nice restaurant around the corner here, are you hungry?>>"
msgstr ""
"vous touche le bras.\n"
"\n"
"<<T'as pas faim ? Je connais un restaurant sympa, c'est juste à côté.>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:612"
msgid ""
"suddenly stiffens.\n"
"\n"
"<<...that man has been following us for a while...>>"
msgstr ""
"se tend brusquement.\n"
"\n"
"<<... ce type là... ça fait un moment qu'il nous suit...>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:613"
msgid "looks at you, waiting."
msgstr "vous regarde patiemment."

msgctxt "woh_small:614"
msgid "smiles faintly."
msgstr "a un bref sourire."

msgctxt "woh_small:615"
msgid ""
"looks around.\n"
"\n"
"<<Did you hear th... nevermind.>>"
msgstr ""
"regarde de tous les côtés.\n"
"\n"
"<<T'as entendu... ? Non, ce n'était rien...>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:616"
msgid ""
"shivers.\n"
"\n"
"<<Is it me or did it suddenly get colder?>>"
msgstr ""
"frissonne.\n"
"\n"
"<<C'est moi où il fait froid, tout d'un coup ?>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:617"
msgid ""
"looks at you and blushes.\n"
"\n"
"<<Good thing we're together in this... right?>>"
msgstr ""
"vous regarde et rougit.\n"
"\n"
"<<C'est cool qu'on traverse tout ça ensemble... non ?>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:618"
msgid "hands you a parting gift! (+1 STAT)"
msgstr "vous tend un cadeau de départ ! (+1 CARA)"

msgctxt "woh_small:619"
msgid "leaves the party!"
msgstr "quitte le groupe !"

msgctxt "woh_small:620"
msgid "--ALLY--"
msgstr "--ACOLYTE--"

msgctxt "woh_small:621"
msgid "FUJIKO"
msgstr "FUJIKO"

msgctxt "woh_small:622"
msgid "your KICK action deals additional 1 DAMAGE"
msgstr "vos COUPS DE PIED infligent 1 DGT supplémentaire"

msgctxt "woh_small:623"
msgid "<<hrmph...>>"
msgstr "<<hmpf...>>"

